```
Every verb is one client operation; the Host decides. Words: 'literal', "escaped", {json} or [json], @FILE (HOME/requests/FILE).
  whoami     whoami
  keygen     keygen FILE
  init       init KEYFILE SUBJECT
  enroll     enroll plan NAME KEYFILE [FACTORY-REF] | enroll seal|submit|lookup NAME
  refs       refs
  read       read REF
  describe   describe REF
  import     import NAME REFERENCE-JSON|@FILE | import NAME KIND TARGET OBSERVE [OPERATION|- [CONTROL]]
  create     create NAME STORAGE PREDICATE-JSON|@FILE
  propose    propose ID REQUEST-JSON|@FILE
  invoke     invoke ID REF create FIELD VALUE | invoke ID REF write FIELD VALUE EXPECTED
  delegate   delegate ID REF RECIPIENT VERB[,VERB...] MAX-COST
  law        law ID REF PREDICATE-JSON|@FILE
  submit     submit ID
  lookup     lookup ID
  retry      retry ID
  publish    publish ID
  export     export ID
  history    history [all]
  help       help [VERB]
  exit       exit
Endings on stderr: usage: (2)  error: client (1)  refused: Host (3)  undecided: Host (4).
```
